+    // m_deviceFeatures access); on true Vulkan 1.3 adapters the core
+    // vk13 struct already has the real value from
+    // vkGetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2, on sub-1.3 adapters (e.g. Mali-G76)
+    // it's queried into the separate EXT struct instead, never
